    "text": "How can a lake this long, fifty-seven kilometers, stay under three meters deep?",
    "shot": "feature",
    "overlay": null,
    "react": null,
    "photo": null
   },
   {
    "text": "So what makes this shallow basin so alkaline despite river inflow?",
    "shot": "close",
    "overlay": {
