     "label": "Earth from ISS",
     "on": "orbit"
    }
   },
   {
    "text": "Its width reaches twenty-two kilometers, showing the lake's massive expanse.",
    "shot": "close",
    "overlay": {
     "type": "ruler",
     "on": "width",
     "label": "22 KM"
    },
    "react": null,
    "photo": null
   },
   {
    "text": "First, mineral-rich hot springs add sodium carbonate and other minerals to the lake.",
    "shot": "close",
    "overlay": null,
    "react": null,
    "photo": null
   },
   {
    "text": "Then intense evaporation leaves natron and trona, pushing pH above twelve.",
    "shot": "close",
    "overlay": {
     "type": "stamp",
     "on": "twelve",
     "label": "pH >12"
    },
    "react": {
